{
  "plan": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "title": "二元一次方程组与一次函数的几何意义",
    "goals": [
      "理解二元一次方程与一次函数的对应关系及图像交点的几何意义",
      "掌握通过代入验证两条直线交点坐标的方法",
      "理解平行线无交点与方程组无解的对应关系"
    ],
    "teaching_strategies": [
      "通过直角坐标系直观演示两条相交直线的交点",
      "代入计算进行代数与几何的双向验证",
      "对比平行直线说明无解的几何本质"
    ],
    "numbers": [
      {
        "initial": 1,
        "min": -5,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "k1"
      },
      {
        "initial": 1,
        "min": -5,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "b1"
      },
      {
        "initial": -1,
        "min": -5,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "k2"
      },
      {
        "initial": 3,
        "min": -5,
        "max": 5,
        "label": "b2"
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "purpose": "在坐标系中展示直线y=x+1与y=-x+3并观察交点",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "function_plot"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "我们在同一平面直角坐标系中画出两条直线，第一条是 y = x + 1，第二条是 y = -x + 3。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "function_plot",
                  "parameters": {
                    "title": "两直线的交点与几何意义",
                    "curve_labels": [
                      "y = x + 1",
                      "y = -x + 3"
                    ],
                    "expressions": [
                      "(x)+(1)",
                      "(-(x))+(3)"
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 3
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\begin{cases} y = x + 1 \\\\ y = -x + 3 \\end{cases}"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "观察两条直线的图像与位置关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "仔细观察可以发现，这两条直线在坐标系中相交于一点，交点坐标是 (1, 2)。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "直线的交点",
                  "items": [
                    "直线 y = x + 1 与 y = -x + 3 相交于点 (1, 2)",
                    "交点坐标同时满足两个函数解析式"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 2,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "local_board_item",
                  "moment": 1,
                  "item": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "通过代入验证交点(1,2)同时满足两个方程",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "观察坐标系，两条直线相交于点 (1, 2)。接下来，我们将这个点的坐标分别代入两个一次函数解析式中进行验证。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导关注两条直线的交点(1,2)",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 3
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "首先代入第一个函数 y = x + 1。当 x 等于 1 时，y 等于 1 加 1 等于 2，左边等于右边，满足第一个方程。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "2 = 1 + 1"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "再代入第二个函数 y = -x + 3。当 x 等于 1 时，y 等于 -1 加 3 也等于 2，同样满足第二个方程。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "2 = -1 + 3"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "这说明交点 (1, 2) 的坐标同时满足这两个方程，它就是对应二元一次方程组的公共解。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\begin{cases} x = 1 \\\\ y = 2 \\end{cases}"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "总结二元一次方程组与直线交点的几何对应关系",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "现在我们来总结二元一次方程组与直线的几何对应关系：求解二元一次方程组的公共解，在几何上就等价于寻找两条直线图像的交点坐标。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "二元一次方程组与直线的几何意义",
                  "items": [
                    "方程组的公共解 ⇔ 两条直线的交点坐标",
                    "方程组无解 ⇔ 两直线平行（无交点）",
                    "方程组有无数解 ⇔ 两直线重合"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "总结二元一次方程组与直线交点的几何对应关系",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "观察平行线无交点并理解方程组无解的情况",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "现在我们来看另一组直线：y = x + 1 和 y = x - 2。它们的斜率都是1，因而在平面上是两条互相平行的直线。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\begin{cases} y = x + 1 \\\\ y = x - 2 \\end{cases}"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 3,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\text{平行线 } \\Leftrightarrow \\text{ 无交点 } \\Leftrightarrow \\text{ 方程组无解}"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "观察两条斜率相同的平行线",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "因为两条直线平行且永不相交，所以它们没有任何公共点。这也对应着该二元一次方程组没有任何解，也就是无解的情况。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                ],
                "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
                "timing": "after_speech"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "close": {
      "summary": "我们学习了二元一次方程组的几何意义：方程组的解就是对应直线图像的交点坐标；相交对应唯一解，平行无交点对应无解。",
      "focus": [
        {
